{"id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-g-system.md","title":"Local Hilbert Presentation of Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-g-system — Local Hilbert Presentation of Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-g-system","aliases":["92-df-g-system"],"display":"df-g-system — Local Hilbert Presentation of Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"],"source":"第 III–V 章；第 XI 章 pp. 129、132–133（PDF 146、149–150）","source_status":"本地 P.A. 呈现，非原书同名系统"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-g-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-g-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-g-system — Local Hilbert Presentation of Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III–V 章；第 XI 章 pp. 129、132–133（PDF 146、149–150）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 P.A. 呈现，非原书同名系统"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (logical axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (arithmetic axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> (modus ponens rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (generalization rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}g\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nG\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{FormalSys}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}g\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nG\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{FormalSys}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> : 本库固定的 P.A. 型形式系统呈现</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> : 包含逻辑符号和算术符号的签名</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\\)</span> : 逻辑公理（命题逻辑和谓词逻辑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> : 算术公理（Peano算术变体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 是规则实例的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 本身不是单个规则实例</li>\n<li>本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 用于标准算术重构；原书对应的算术系统主要记作 P.A.</li>\n<li>系统G可以表达和证明足够多的算术事实</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文件的三元组保留为本库的 P.A. 型 Hilbert 呈现，并沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 标签以保持已有依赖。原书先用 P.E.、再用 P.A.，其具体逻辑公理是 Kalish–Montague 形式；第 XI 章的 Type G 是可证性系统性质，模态系统 G 是另一公理系统。三者不应被称为本文件的同一个系统。原书内容分别见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a>与书籍信息。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III–V 章；第 XI 章 pp. 129、132–133（PDF 146、149–150）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axiom set, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-p